{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">美國通脹略高於預期，強化市場對聯邦儲備局加息的預期，金價回軟。現貨金價跌逾百分之1，跌穿4,600美元水平。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">至於紐約期金，收市報4,653.3美元一盎司，跌41.2美元，跌幅百分之0.8。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T01:14:02.587923+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}